<title>DUBAI: U.S. actor unveils Dubai Planet Hollywood.</title>
<headline>U.S. actor unveils Dubai Planet Hollywood.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>American movie heart throb Patrick Swayze rode into a Dubai mall on a white Arabian horse on Sunday to unveil the Middle East's first Planet Hollywood merchandise store.</p>
<p>Dressed in traditional Gulf Arab attire, the star of &quot;Dirty Dancing&quot;, &quot;Ghost&quot; and other hit films launched the store which will open its doors to the public on December 15.</p>
</text>
